[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_4xuhh"]
script = ExtResource("5_xyuwe")
markedup_text = "Choose the one who fears death."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_f2op8")
outcome = SubResource("Resource_tuogj")
markedup_result_text = "Their question is clear, almost clinical: when, how, and why.

At dawn, the wall bears new cracks: five parallel lines. Just enough to know the stone understood.

The settler says nothing and simply sits down, dejected. When he stands up, he has a little splinter of stone in his hand."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_rx1a8"]
script = ExtResource("11_63wcp")
card_type = ExtResource("10_0hb80")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cqnoecri6xisf"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_w2hpu"]
script = ExtResource("9_bjnwa")
aspect_type = ExtResource("12_guy20")
min_count = 3
extra_per_season = 1

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_3sdrw"]
script = ExtResource("5_xyuwe")
markedup_text = "Choose the one who wonders about the wall's nature."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_w2hpu")
outcome = SubResource("Resource_rx1a8")
markedup_result_text = "\"What are you?\" the question reads, simple and to the point.

The cracks that appear at dawn are complicated, but a scholar is willing to study them.

After hours of tracing and comparison, she finally declares success. The cracks, she says, bear a striking resemblance to an ancient form of a familiar glyph."

